  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 925152ecbd7f4f3428b5b499a2a4771a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cockroach: {fileID: 0}
  player: {fileID: 0}
  cockroach2: {fileID: 764335836479249814}
  cup: {fileID: 0}
  strings:
  - Splendid! Akhm... THOU, CHILD, HAST BEEN CHOSEN BY GOD HIMSELF!  Thou art marked
    by fate to gather the scattered pieces of His sacred body and restore Him to
    His former glory! Go, my child, go into my garde- errr, into the wild... wildness...
    and fulfill thy glorious destiny!
  - "But the village's gate\u2019s been blocked for, like, a month. And that thing
    out there is huge!"
  - Alright pal, listen up. Some of your folks have this... mystic magic, a power
    to change things. That thing blocking your way out, it doesn't belong to your
    world, does it? Why won't you just... go there and try to make it smaller?
  - Mystic magic...? Is it because I'm this "Chosen One"?
  - No, yeah, right, totally. Yes. That's why. So go there and try to use it!
